# 1. Web3Forms (Free Form-to-Email Service -> Sends directly to your Gmail)
# How to get it:
#   1. Visit https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter your email: phallymakara01@gmail.com
#   3. Paste the Access Key received in your email here:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

# 2. Telegram Bot Notifications (Sends instant alerts to your Telegram phone app)
# How to get it:
#   Step 1: Open Telegram and search for @BotFather -> send "/newbot" -> copy the BOT_TOKEN
#   Step 2: Search for @userinfobot or @getidsbot -> send any message -> copy your numeric CHAT_ID
#   Step 3: Paste both values below:
VITE_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token_here
VITE_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_telegram_chat_id_here

